  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Really good, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I just got a raise! Like a real one.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "block": "personal_finance.dlg27",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Congratulations! That's exciting. Any plans for it?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.85,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "personal_finance.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Not yet. I want to enjoy it but also not be stupid.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 1.26,
   "block": "personal_finance.dlg27",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A nice approach is to split it. Maybe half for savings or goals, half for enjoying life a little more.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.85,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "personal_finance.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Half sounds like a lot to save.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.06,
   "block": "personal_finance.dlg27",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's only the new money, though. Your current lifestyle stays the same, you just don't let it all creep up.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.53,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "personal_finance.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, that's",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 1.41,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "personal_finance.dlg27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "actually pretty painless when you put it that way.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 2.07,
   "block": "personal_finance.dlg27",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
